OL,3,GNorth West                             
OL,5,CToday:FToday will remain dry with      
OL,6,Fvariable cloud. It will feel chilly    
OL,7,Fwith an easterly breeze and            
OL,8,Ftemperatures near or just below        
OL,9,Faverage for the time of year.          
OL,11,CTonight:FA chilly night to follow,     
OL,12,Fwith high cloud and perhaps a few      
OL,13,Fclear spells developing before dawn    
OL,14,Fallowing temperatures to drop off with 
OL,15,Fa widespread frost. Remaining dry but  
OL,16,Fbreezy.                                
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
