OL,3,GNorth West                             
OL,5,CThursday:FRemaining dry on Thursday    
OL,6,Fwith a few brighter spells developing  
OL,7,Flater in the south. Turning breezy     
OL,8,Fwith strong winds developing towards   
OL,9,Fcoasts and over hills by evening.      
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRain     
OL,12,Fspreads eastwards on Friday,           
OL,13,Fpersistent at times and turning wintry 
OL,14,Fover hills. Turning drier on Saturday  
OL,15,Fas winds ease, before rain arrives     
OL,16,Fagain on Sunday. Frosty overnight.     
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
